Description: Network restriction bypass tool for Linux
 SplitWire-Turkey is a comprehensive network bypass tool that provides:
  - WireGuard VPN with split tunneling support
  - DPI (Deep Packet Inspection) bypass using Zapret/nfqws
  - ByeDPI proxy for application-specific routing
  - DNS management with DoH (DNS over HTTPS) support
  - Discord repair and alternative client installation
 .
 Features:
  - Modern GTK4/Libadwaita interface
  - Multiple bypass methods (WireGuard, Zapret, ByeDPI)
  - Split tunneling for specific applications
  - Multi-language support (Turkish, English, Russian, Spanish)
  - systemd service integration
